e">=</span><span class="hl-quotes">&quot;</span><span class="hl-string">btn2 btn-success</span><span class="hl-quotes">&quot;</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> Forgot password?</span><span class="hl-brackets">&lt;/</span><span class="hl-reserved">button</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-brackets">&lt;/</span><span class="hl-reserved">form</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-brackets">&lt;/</span><span class="hl-reserved">body</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> </span><span class="hl-brackets">&lt;/</span><span class="hl-reserved">html</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> [[/html]]</span> </pre></div> </div> <p><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong></p> <ul> <li>The login button won't redirect if the password field is empty.</li> <li>This login format is made for articles that use offsets. Change the placeholder text to the proper offset link for your article.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Option 2-<em>suboption</em></span></strong><br /> <strong>What it looks like:</strong></p> <div class="log-form"> <p><span class="logint"><br /> <br /> SCiPNET LOGIN<br /> <br /></span></p> <div class="input-container true-form"></div> <br /> <a class="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-style-resource" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-style-resource">link</a></div> <div class="log-form"> <p><span class="logint"><br /> <br /> SCiPNET LOGIN<br /> <br /></span></p> <div class="input-container true-form"></div> <br /> <a class="btn-false" href="btn-false">Login</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">collapsible</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link"