/a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> seedpod.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> 5158 Seedpod<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Modified by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608087177" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span>, source owner is PePeEfe<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Puerto_L%C3%A1pice_meteorite_-_Ciudad_Real,_Spain_-_Museo_Geominero.JPG">Wikimedia Commons</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> nerva.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> MV Nerva (Docked)<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Modified by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608087177" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span>, source owner is Barry Lewis<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC-BY-SA 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MV_%22Frigo_Espana%22.jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about o