					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5461</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Safe</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5461-1 is to be contained inside a Storage Locker inside Site-76. All Instances of SCP-5461-2 are to be terminated if they are the following colors: Red, Purple, Indigo, Lime.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5461-1 is a small plastic bag, of the variety usually used in candy stores to put self-served candy inside. Written on the &quot;front&quot; of the bag in Sharpie<sup>tm</sup> brand marker is the incription, 'yumy gummie bear by dado'. SCP-5461-1 holds a small amount of gummy bears, which are classified SCP-5461-2. SCP-5461-2 are mildly sapient, and possess different amounts of sentience,depending on their color. they are also capable of giving artificial feelings to those who consume. The following color categories are</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>Color of SCP-5462-1</th> <th>Personality and Sentience</th> <th>Amnesty or Termination orders</th> </tr> <tr> <td>Red 'razzie bear'</td> <td>Extremely hostile, sentience equivalent to a five-year-old child.</td> <td>To be terminated immediately. subjects who eat describe &quot;unabated anger.&quot; and the taste of raspberry.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Orange 'ornagie bear'</td> <td>Sighs to itself and moves slowly. Sentience equivalent to a 15-year-old child's.</td> <td>To be given limited privileges and eaten after 5 days. subjects who eat describe feelings of &quot;melancholy.&quot; and the taste of orange.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Yellow 'sunshiney ber'</td> <td>Extremely effusive. Sentience of a 3-year-old child.</td> <td>To be given limited privileges and eaten after two weeks. subjects who eat describe a feeling of &quot;extreme happiness.&quot; and the taste of lemon.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Lime 'sour bar'</td> <td>Dour and annoyed. sentience of a 23-year-old adult, with chauvinistic views.</td> <td>To be terminated immediately. subjects who try describe a feeling of &quot;annoyance, and suicidal views.&quot; and the taste of lime.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Blue 'cool bear'</td> <td>Only instance wearing an article of clothing (glasses.) will walk around and attract other instances. Sentience of a 9-year-old child.</td> <td>To be given limited privileges, and killed after 3 days. subjects who eat describe feelings of &quot;cool happiness.&quot; and the taste of blueberry.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Indigo 'odd bear'</td> <td>Tries to eat other instances.</td> <td>To be Terminated immediately. Subjects who eat describe the feeling of &quot;Estrangement.&quot; along with the taste of poppy seeds. It is unknown why this taste is the one chosen.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Purple 'yucky bear'</td> <td>Disgusted, with an air of superiority. Sentience equivalent to a 15-year-old child.</td> <td>To be terminated immediately. subjects who eat describe a feeling of &quot;toxicity.&quot; along with the taste of [DATA EXPUNGED]</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Brown 'dark bear'</td> <td>Dark, broody. Keeps to itself.</td> <td>To be given limited privileges and eaten after 5 hours. Subjects describe a feeling of &quot;disturbance.&quot; and note the taste of Cocoa.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Clear 'brightie beear'</td> <td>Smart, large knowledge of the foundation.</td> <td>To be turned into Junior Researchers for the foundation. If eaten, subject will [DATA EXPUNGED], leaving large amount of flyers for 'dado's gumy bears' all over the Testing Chamber's floor.</td> </tr> </table> <p><strong>Discovery:</strong> SCP-5461 was found in a warehouse registered to 'dado and friends' in Burlington,Vermont, inside of a large cardboard box. Next to the box was a recently registered phone, known as a &quot;burner&quot; phone. On the phone was the following text stream. dado is shown in red, while the unidentified number is in blue.</p> <div style="display: inline-block ; border : dashed 1px #444444 ; background :#F5F5F5 ; margin-left : auto ; margin-right : auto ; width : 700px ; padding:10px"> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">Hey, you there? dado?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">yes. this dado.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">how you doing?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">making pill. pill not good. so dado sad.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">So, you need a better pill?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">no. dado want something else, something happy.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">So, like candy?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">yes. candy good. dado like good candy.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">So make some candy!</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">maybe. dado must think. dado wants special candy.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">What kind of special?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">hm. dado think gumy bear. gumy bear yumy. yumy gumy.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">That's it! gummies!</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">not gummies. gumy. happy gumy, sad gumy, mad gumy. special gumy.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">Ok? when do you think you'll have them?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">o. they done.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">Really?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">yes.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">And they work?</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">yes. dado wants to throw hamster.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">well, guess you ate a bad one.</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">this is dado. dado do good.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">Alright. I hope you enjoy.</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">thank you. I will give u some gumy. go to Burlington, 87th and main, the wearhouse. enjoy. just dont throw hamster.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">Ok,buddy. see you there.</span></p> </div> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5460">SCP-5460</a> | SCP-5461 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5462">SCP-5462</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theanimatefry" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5927653&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608087179" alt="TheAnimateFry" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5927653)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theanimatefry" >TheAnimateFry</a></span></p> 
